      "text": "Pepita d’oro puro dal luccichio sfavillante.\nSi può vendere a un prezzo piuttosto alto\nnei negozi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A nugget of the purest gold that gives off a lustrous\ngleam in direct light. It can be sold at a high price\nto shops.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "キラキラと　金色に　光る\n純金製の　玉。\nショップで　高く　売れる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "闪着金光，\n以纯金制成的珠子。\n可以在商店高价出售。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pepita de oro puro que desprende un brillo\nespectacular. Puede venderse a un precio muy alto en\nlas tiendas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
